g-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:mt-16" data-statement="true">Two hundred and forty hectares where the ocean, the pine forest and the open heath were <em class="font-serif font-normal">left to lead.</em> We didn't lay a course onto the land. We <em class="font-serif font-normal">uncovered</em> the one already inside it.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><figure class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A lone golfer carrying a bag along a dewy fairway at first light, with sea mist and pines beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw" src="/images/golf-first-light.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground"><span>First light on the opening fairway</span><span>Hole 1</span></figcaption></figure><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 lg:col-span-3 lg:py-8"><div data-reveal="true"><p class="max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75">The routing follows the natural contours from the first tee to the last green. There are no forced carries over manufactured lakes and no imported sand. The bunkers are the dunes, and the hazards are the ones the land already had.</p><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mt-8" href="/morrow-original/course"><span class="relative py-1">Explore the course<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></spa