-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-3 p-3 sm:p-5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden rounded-full bg-paper/85 px-3 py-2 backdrop-blur sm:block"><div class="flex h-1.5 w-28 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-charcoal/30"><span class="h-full w-1/2 bg-charcoal/70"></span></div><div class="mt-1 flex justify-between font-mono text-[9px] text-charcoal/60"><span>0</span><span>200 m</span></div></div><div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-2"><p class="rounded-full bg-charcoal/90 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone sm:text-[10px]">Hole <!-- -->01<!-- --> · Par <!-- -->4<!-- --> · <!-- -->402<!-- --> yds</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="signature-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-charcoal text-bone" id="signature-holes"><div class="relative flex flex-col lg:h-[100svh] lg:min-h-[640px] lg:overflow-hidden"><div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6 px-5 pt-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pt-24"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70"><span class="tabular-nums">03</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Signature holes</span></p><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/60"><span class="text-bone">01</span> <!-- -->/ <!-- -->05</p></div><div class="no-scrollbar mt-10 snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1 lg:motion-safe:snap-none lg:motion-safe:overflow-visible"><div class="flex w-max gap-5 px-5 pb-8 sm:gap-6 sm:px-8 lg:h-full lg:gap-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-10"><div class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col justify-between gap-8 sm:w-[56vw] lg:w-[30vw] lg:pr-6"><div><h2 class="text-[clamp(2.1rem,3.6vw,3.6rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="signature-heading">Five holes you'll talk about <em class="font-serif font-normal">on the drive home.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Each one was found on foot long before it was drawn. Walk them in a different light and they play like different holes.</p></div><p class="hidden items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/60 lg:flex">Keep scrolling<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></p></div><article aria-label="Hole 4, The Pines" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A fairway bending left around a grove of ancient umbrella pines in early morning light" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-pines.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->04</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->7</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">04</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">The Pines</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->4<!-- --> · <!-- -->412<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">A dogleg left that bends around a stand of two-hundred-year-old umbrella pines. Take them on and a wedge remains; play away and a long iron finds a shelf green tucked into the forest edge.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Carry over the corner: 238 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 7, Quarry" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A par three green framed by the cut rock walls of an old stone quarry" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-quarry.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->07</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->15</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">07</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Quarry</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->3<!-- --> · <!-- -->187<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">The tee sits on the lip of a quarry that supplied stone to the region for three centuries. The green is framed by the rock face itself, so a missed shot is simply gone.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Carry to the front: 164 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 11, Long Heath" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A long fairway through flowering coastal heath rolling toward the ocean" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-heath.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->11</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->4</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">11</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Long Heath</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->5<!-- --> · <!-- -->568<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">The longest hole on the estate crosses open heathland in flower from March to June. Three disciplined shots, a patient putter, and the ocean in view the whole way.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Heath in flower: March to June</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 16, Mirror" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A peninsula green on a still reservoir at dawn, its flag reflected in the water" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-mirror.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->16</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->16</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">16</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Mirror</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->3<!-- --> · <!-- -->164<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">A peninsula green reaching into the reservoir with water on three sides. On still mornings the flag appears twice, once in the air and once in the water.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Green depth: 28 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 18, The Return" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="The final green below a low rammed earth clubhouse with a long timber roof, glowing at dusk" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-return.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->18</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->6</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">18</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">The Return</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->4<!-- --> · <!-- -->461<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">Uphill toward the clubhouse, where the terrace watches every approach. A generous fairway and a fiercely contoured green make it a hole of nerve.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Climbs 21 m to the green</p></div></article><div class="flex w-[70vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col justify-end gap-6 sm:w-[40vw] lg:w-[24vw] lg:pb-4"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.8rem,2.6vw,2.6rem)] leading-[1.1] text-bone/90">Thirteen more, and not one of them filler.</p><a class="inline-flex h-12 w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal" href="#course-map">See the full routing<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="mx-5 mb-10 h-px bg-bone/15 sm:mx-8 lg:mx-12 lg:mb-10"><span class="block h-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-ochre"></span></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="clubhouse-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="clubhouse"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-8"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">04</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Clubhouse &amp; architecture</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.4vw,4.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="clubhouse-heading">Built from the ground <em class="font-serif font-normal">it stands on.</em></h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">The clubhouse is set into the slope above the 18th green, its walls pressed from the estate's own earth and its roof drawn as one long timber line. From the fairway it almost disappears. From the terrace you can see the whole course.</p><ol class="mt-12 border-t border-charcoal/15"><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">01</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Rammed earth</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Walls pressed by hand from soil excavated on site, a building method native to the Alentejo for a thousand years.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">02</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Timber canopy</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">A 64-metre roof of cross-laminated larch, cantilevered over the terrace without a single column.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">03</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Frameless glass</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">The pavilion opens fully onto the 18th green, so the course becomes the fourth wall.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">04</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Passive climate</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Thermal mass, cross-ventilation and a solar canopy replace air conditioning entirely.</p></div></li></ol><div class="mt-10" data-reveal="true"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" href="/morrow-original/clubhouse"><span class="relative py-1">Inside the clubhouse<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></span></span><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-current/30 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:border-current"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><figure><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-t-full bg-sand sm:aspect-[5/6] lg:aspect-[4/5]" data-arch="true"><div class="absolute inset-0" data-arch-image="true"><img alt="The modern clubhouse with its long flat roof and glowing glass, a row of carts and an olive tree in front" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/clubhouse-carts.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:30% center;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/60 to-transparent"></div><p class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone sm:bottom-7 sm:left-7 sm:right-7 sm:text-[11px]"><span>The clubhouse</span><span>Above the 18th green</span></p></div></figure></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:mt-28 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end"><figure class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[16/10] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="left"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="The clubhouse terrace on the cliff edge, with coastal fairways stretching along the sea below" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 66vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/cliff-terrace.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:30% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground"><span>The terrace on the cliff above the coast holes</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">1,850 m² under one roof</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px] lg:aspect-[3/4]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A golfer walking past the cart court toward the lit clubhouse terrace at sunset" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/clubhouse-arrival.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:36% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">Arriving for a twilight round</figcaption></figure></div><dl class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">timber canopy without columns</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="64" data-decimals="0">64</span> m</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of clubhouse under one roof</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="1850" data-decimals="0">1,850</span> m²</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of daytime power from the solar canopy</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="100" data-decimals="0">100</span>%</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">air conditioning units, by design</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="0" data-decimals="0">0</span></span></dd></div></dl></div></section><section aria-labelledby="academy-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-forest text-bone" id="academy"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full text-bone opacity-[0.06]" focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid slice" viewbox="0 0 1600 1200"><g aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></g></svg><div class="relative px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70"><span class="tabular-nums">05</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Academy &amp; practice</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.6vw,4.6rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="academy-heading">Practice, <em class="font-serif font-normal">measured to the millimetre.</em></h2></div><div class="self-end lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-bone/75" data-reveal="true">Every bay, green and bunker in the Academy is tracked, so practice turns into progress you can see. The technology stays out of sight. The feedback doesn't.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-5" data-reveal="true"><button class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-bone px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal transition-colors hover:bg-ochre" type="button">Book a lesson<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" href="/morrow-original/academy"><span class="relative py-1">Explore the Academy<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></span></span><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-current/30 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:border-current"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><ol class="lg:col-span-5"><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-100" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A golfer mid-swing in a covered range bay at dusk, with the floodlit range stretching beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/golf-academy-range.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">The Range</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">Forty-eight bays, half covered and heated, with ball-flight tracking on every one. Target greens stretch 320 metres and are shaped like the course’s own.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">48 tracked bays</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">320 m range</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">06:30 to 22:00</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A flagstick on an immaculate green above the bay as the sun sets behind the mountains" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/green-at-sunset.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:82% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Short Game Park</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">Three hectares of chipping greens, pitching areas and bunkers, built from the same sand and turf as the championship course.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">3 hectares</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">7 practice greens</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Course-matched sand</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A golfer crouching to read a putt beside the flag, the bay and mountains behind" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/reading-the-putt.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:38% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Putting Lab</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">An indoor studio where laser guides and a pressure-mapped green show exactly how your stroke starts the ball rolling.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Pressure-mapped green</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Laser alignment</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Video review</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="An iron resting behind a ball on dewy turf, fairways and the bay softly out of focus" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/iron-and-ball.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:52% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Performance Studio</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">3D motion capture, launch monitoring and custom club fitting, with your analysis sent to your phone after every session.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">3D motion capture</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Custom fitting</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Session reports</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A wide fairway framed by bunkers and a still lake, rising toward a villa among the pines" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/fairway-panorama.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:58% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">05</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">The Short Nine</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">A floodlit par-three course of nine holes from 68 to 142 yards, open until eleven at night. Built for quick rounds, first 