e and the course itself are yours to shape. Our events team handles everything from the tee sheet to the last dance.</p></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-bone/15 pt-8"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-xs leading-snug text-bone/60 sm:text-sm">guests seated in the Pavilion</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="240" data-decimals="0">240</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-xs leading-snug text-bone/60 sm:text-sm">holes for a shotgun start</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="18" data-decimals="0">18</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-xs leading-snug text-bone/60 sm:text-sm">lodges for overnight guests</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="24" data-decimals="0">24</span></span></dd></div></dl><button class="inline-flex h-12 w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-bone px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal transition-colors hover:bg-ochre" data-reveal="true" type="button">Plan an event<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="nature-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="nature"><div class="relative h-[100svh] min-h-[560px] overflow-hidden bg-pine"><div class="absolute inset-0" data-nature-image="true"><img alt="Fairways curving around a lagoon beneath umbrella pines, the bay shining at sunset" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/lagoon-holes.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center 60%;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/25 to-pine/10"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-12 text-bone sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-16"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/80"><span class="tabular-nums">09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Lifestyle &amp; nature</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 max-w-5xl font-serif text-[clamp(2.8rem,7.4vw,8rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.01em]" data-nature-title="true" id="nature-heading">Golf is only <em>half the day.</em></h2><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end"><p class="max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-bone/85 lg:col-span-6" data-nature-copy="true">Swim in the reservoir before breakfast, run thirty kilometres of trail through the pines, or take the boardwalk down to a beach you'll probably have to yourself. The estate is as much nature reserve as golf course.</p><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70 lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 lg:text-right" data-nature-copy="true">Protected dune habitat · Since 2021</p></div></div></div><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6 lg:gap-8"><article class=""><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A timber jetty reaching into the still, misty reservoir" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 32vw, 100vw" src="/images/nature-swim-1.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-6 text-xl font-medium uppercase" data-reveal="true">The Reservoir</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">Cold-water swims from the jetty at sunrise, and paddleboards whenever the wind drops.</p></article><article class="md:mt-24"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="Tall pines along a sunlit grassy slope with mist rising behind" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 32vw, 100vw" src="/images/hole-pines-2.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-6 text-xl font-medium uppercase" data-reveal="true">Pine Trails</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">Thirty-one kilometres of marked trails for walking, running and cycling, mapped in the member app.</p></article><article class="md:mt-10"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="Pale grasses on the clifftop above a calm blue ocean" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 32vw, 100vw" src="/images/hole-heath-2.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-6 text-xl font-medium uppercase" data-reveal="true">The Beach</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">A twelve-minute boardwalk through the dunes to four kilometres of sand you will usually have to yourself.</p></article></div><dl class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-10 lg:mt-28 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of heathland restored since 2021</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="142" data-decimals="0">142</span> ha</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">bird species recorded on the estate</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="86" data-decimals="0">86</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of irrigation from recycled water</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="100" data-decimals="0">100</span>%</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of trails through the pines</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="31" data-decimals="0">31</span> km</span></dd></div></dl><div class="mt-14" data-reveal="true"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" href="/morrow-original/nature"><span class="relative py-1">Nature and 